<title>CANADA: Provigo Inc Q2 profit slips.</title>
<headline>Provigo Inc Q2 profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q2 ended August 10</p>
<p>				1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.18		   C$0.22</p>
<p> Net			 20,100		   21,700</p>
<p> Revs		   1,805,900		1,796,200</p>
<p>	   6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.31		   C$0.34</p>
<p> Net			 35,100		   35,100</p>
<p> Revs		   3,112,600		3,055,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Above earnings per shares are fully diluted. Basic earnings totalled C$0.19 a share for 16 weeks ended August 10.</p>
<p>In 1995 profits were C$0.23 a share for the 16 weeks ended August 12.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
